    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/abc44906f8a56c60f0e48244715ad3b7.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/ab26880e5045cbf1a2ba3aea06409979.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/997275d2364e00aeefe97f2887791bb5.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><br>A stable job, a caring and sweet girlfriend...... You were supposed to have a lavish dinner with your girlfriend on Christmas Eve, but what you didn't expect was to be fired, broken up with, and the &quot;Christmas gift&quot; she gave you - a loan shark contract! Wait, a loan shark contract!?<br>After your ex-girlfriend dumped you and disappeared overnight, you were forced to live a life of working to pay off your huge amount of debt out of nowhere......<br>But here is where things take a turn -- <br>Your former childhood friend, <br>A music college student, <br>A wealthy and sexy big sis, <br>And an eccentric mystery novel author\u2026<br>Watch as your fateful encounters with these girls spark a rapidly flourishing relationship!<br>But can you take your relationships with them a step further while you are still neck deep in debt? What about their true selves deep inside? Can you still find your ex-girlfriend who is the cause of all this mess?<br>This is where a story of debt &amp; love begins......<br><br>In this game, you will play as the protagonist and watch his life stories unfold through a series of choices - from self-improvement, earning money, and ultimately successfully pay off his debt to escape the lowest of lows in life! The game has a wide variety of different careers for you to experience, while also having the chance to meet four women each with their own distinctive personalities. <br>What kind of ending lies ahead of you......?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/1983ed1333925fabb367ad9c81974d3d.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/71af4c9d851f0ce40eff99c6f72440e5.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/6c624274b9572dc338b4b032763771ae.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/68a58a80379a43d50eed21e36ec81b04.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/25b90864190e1db50b4538b72654dfad.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/00618cb6bf91e6e5d9f913f23cb1acda.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/2d59e273496b8a2ba71bc18a8464301c.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/0fbf993a9feafafb0567731660bd758d.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2533700/extras/8625035af64b2849ee6e64fadd5efb38.avif?t=1747016957\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\